  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICRC operations by the Gulf Cooperation Council (regional) Delegation(2023 Unaudited)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ICRC&#x2019;s Kuwait City delegation promotes the incorporation of international humanitarian law into national legislation and conducts military training in countries of the Gulf Cooperation Council. It also protects detainees and handles humanitarian matters arising from the 1990-1991 Gulf War.</narrative>
